Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.10,0:12:26.64,TEATIME-ED-TOP,ED,0,0,0,,	{\blur3}	空があかく染まって
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.64,0:12:34.48,TEATIME-ED-TOP,ED,0,0,0,,	{\blur3}	不条理を憎んでもここからは
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.90,0:12:38.57,TEATIME-ED-TOP,ED,0,0,0,,	{\blur3}	逃げ出せないから Decided
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.41,0:12:43.95,TEATIME-ED-TOP,ED,0,0,0,,	{\blur3}	光へ手をのばして
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.41,0:12:43.95,TEATIME-ED-TOP,ED,0,0,0,,{\pos(842,3)}	{\blur3\fs28}	あした
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.95,0:12:48.91,TEATIME-ED-TOP,ED,0,0,0,,	{\blur3}	Find the truth, will arrive someday
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.91,0:12:54.21,TEATIME-ED-TOP,ED,0,0,0,,	{\blur3}	追いかけても追いかけても　未だ
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.21,0:12:59.84,TEATIME-ED-TOP,ED,0,0,0,,	{\blur3}	守りたいものさえ消えていくけど
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.01,0:13:04.47,TEATIME-ED-TOP,ED,0,0,0,,	{\blur3}	足掻き続けるしかないの
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.47,0:13:05.97,TEATIME-ED-TOP,ED,0,0,0,,	{\blur3}	ねぇ、聞いて
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.97,0:13:10.73,TEATIME-ED-TOP,ED,0,0,0,,	{\blur3}	Find the truth, promise to yourself
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.73,0:13:16.19,TEATIME-ED-TOP,ED,0,0,0,,	{\blur3}	いくつもの顔で塗り変えて行く未来
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.19,0:13:23.82,TEATIME-ED-TOP,ED,0,0,0,,	{\blur3\fad(0,200)}	戻らない時間を胸にそっとしまって
